BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pass Mountain Trail Runs
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTSTAMP:20261008T175550Z
UID:7d25a34433a81f3f79b98bec@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:This is the second race in the Aravaipa Running –[Desert Run
 ner Trail Series](https://www.aravaiparunning.com/desert-runner-trail-seri
 es/)\, Arizona’s premier trail & ultra-run series. Courses feature windi
 ng trails through Cholla Forests\, views of Pass Mountain\, and the Supers
 tition Mountain range before climbing up Pass Mountain in the Tonto Nation
 al Forest. Distances include a 50-mile\, 50K\, 25K\, 10K\, and 5K. [](http
 ://www.aravaiparunning.com/pass-mountain/)\n\nEvent website: http://www.ar
 avaiparunning.com/pass-mountain/\n\nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.vis
 itarizona.com/events/pass-mountain-trail-runs
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T175550Z
LOCATION:Usery Mountain Regional Park Nature Center\, North Usery Pass Roa
 d\, Mesa\, AZ\, USA
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/pass-mountain-trail-runs
END:VEVENT
